{% comment %}
  Trophy Mart â€” Footer section (Tailwind-compiled design, mirrors src/components/Footer.tsx).

  This file is self-contained: the compiled Tailwind CSS and all artwork live inside it.
  Upload ONLY sections/footer.liquid - no extra CSS or image files.

  Install: Online Store â†’ Themes â†’ Customize â†’ Footer â†’ Add section â†’
  "Trophy Mart Footer". Remove Dawn's default "Footer" section so only this
  footer renders.

  The three link columns come from the Shopify panel (link lists in the
  section settings); while no menu is picked, the built-in Trophy Mart lists
  are used, matching the React design exactly. Brand text, contact details
  and the copyright line are editable in the section settings.
{% endcomment %}

